'''Trixi the Merc''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Best of the Best (Gacha Event)/10 Year Special|Best of the Best]] gacha event. She was added to BCTW and BCKR in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]], [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]] and [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

